# ===== 行尾正規化(TD-13:解決 CRLF 混入)=====
# 預設:所有文字檔在 repo 內統一存 LF
* text=auto eol=lf

# Frozen P2-03 evidence fixtures must retain their authorized bytes verbatim.
# Treat their preserved CRLF endings as line endings during whitespace checks.
regression/fixtures/p203/** -text -eol whitespace=cr-at-eol

# Windows 批次檔必須保持 CRLF,否則舊版 cmd 可能誤解析
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf

# 明確標記二進位檔,避免 git 誤做行尾轉換
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.ico binary
*.sqlite3 binary
*.zip binary
